"There's an ability \nMight be rare but allegeds stability\n\nThe curse of thinking\nUsually pretty usefull\nComes in handy\nAnd keeps the situation cool\n\nThe dark side do exist\nAs it forces to over-analyze\nCompels one to always think\nAnd makes many situations, realize\n\nForces one to overthink\nPerhaps the biggest drawback\nAs well as some boon to bear\nIf the analysis delays the setback\n\nChanges your view\nBy which you see others\nIf they fail to observe\nYou'll disgust them forever\n\nPrevents cringe habits\nAnd avoid those having them\nMany might climb on you\nLike you're some kind of stem\n\nIt gives you some morals\nAnd apathize sympathy\nThose who seek it exist\nAnd when you don't, they envy\n\nThe curse of thinking\nIt is as it is\nCan't change its nature\nAnd have to bear as it is"